      ],
      "source": "https://www.cameronwi.gov/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "L.C. Stanley, a wealthy lumberman from Chippewa Falls, platted the land where Old Cameron was located in 1882.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cameronwi.gov/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Chippewa Falls and Northern Railway helped establish the settlement when it passed through the area in the late 1800s.",
